bluejetty:00085483:android.description:
Beeline TV is not just an opportunity to watch TV channels, new movies, cartoons and TV series, it is online television of a new generation! All genres - action, comedy and much more. A TV program for every taste and mood will help you have a good time, as well as free traffic for Beeline subscribers*.
Updated Beeline TV service in a modern interface:
📺 More than 300 Russian and foreign TV channels of various topics;
📑 Convenient TV program and archive of TV shows over the past 3 days;
💥 New movies, favorite films and cartoons from leading Hollywood and Russian studios;
📲 Connect up to 5 devices to one account;
👍 Use the service on any mobile or wi-fi network.
20 terrestrial TV channels are available to all users free of charge.
*except for traffic from advertising in all-Russian mandatory public TV channels.

